   "widgets_values": [
    "Character name: KAILANI\nScope: Live-action film\nArt style: photorealistic photograph, real person, natural skin texture, DSLR photo, 85mm lens, soft natural daylight, sharp focus, true-to-life colors. Not a drawing, not an illustration, not anime, not a 3D render.\nCharacter: a lean athletic surfer woman in her early twenties with sun-kissed tan skin, wavy sun-bleached hair streaked with ocean-blue tips tied in a loose messy braid, light turquoise-blue eyes.\nDefault outfit: a coral-orange rash guard top and white boardshorts, barefoot, a silver ankle bracelet.\nSignature prop: a yellow surfboard with a hibiscus flower decal.\nSetting: a sunny beach surf town.\nColor palette: turquoise, coral-orange, sand-tan and white.\nVoice: a young woman in her early twenties with a bright, warm, slightly husky mid-high voice; relaxed and upbeat, laid-back surfer energy, a smile in her voice, natural conversational pace, clear articulation."
