    "## Models & LoRAs used by this flow — download links\n\nDownload on the host only (`ssh gaguilar@172.16.0.101`), into `~/git/ComfyUI/models/<folder>/`.\n\n| Folder | File | Download | Page |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| diffusion_models | wan2.2_s2v_14B_fp8_scaled.safetensors | [file](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Wan_2.2_ComfyUI_Repackaged/resolve/main/split_files/diffusion_models/wan2.2_s2v_14B_fp8_scaled.safetensors) | [Wan 2.2 repack](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Wan_2.2_ComfyUI_Repackaged) |\n| audio_encoders | wav2vec2_large_english_fp16.safetensors | [file](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Wan_2.2_ComfyUI_Repackaged/resolve/main/split_files/audio_encoders/wav2vec2_large_english_fp16.safetensors) | [Wan 2.2 repack](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Wan_2.2_ComfyUI_Repackaged) |\n| text_encoders | umt5_xxl_fp8_e4m3fn_scaled.safetensors | [file](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Wan_2.1_ComfyUI_repackaged/resolve/main/split_files/text_encoders/umt5_xxl_fp8_e4m3fn_scaled.safetensors) | [Wan 2.1 repack](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Wan_2.1_ComfyUI_repackaged) |\n| vae | wan_2.1_vae.safetensors | [file](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Wan_2.2_ComfyUI_Repackaged/resolve/main/split_files/vae/wan_2.1_vae.safetensors) | [Wan 2.2 repack](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Wan_2.2_ComfyUI_Repackaged) |\n| loras | wan2.2_t2v_lightx2v_4steps_lora_v1.1_high_noise.safetensors (strength 1.0, no trigger) | [file](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Wan_2.2_ComfyUI_Repackaged/resolve/main/split_files/loras/wan2.2_t2v_lightx2v_4steps_lora_v1.1_high_noise.safetensors) | [lightx2v Wan2.2-Lightning](https://huggingface.co/lightx2v/Wan2.2-Lightning) |\n| qwen-tts/Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-1.7B-VoiceDesign | whole HF repo (folder) | `hf download Qwen/Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-1.7B-VoiceDesign --local-dir …` | [Qwen3-TTS VoiceDesign](https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-1.7B-VoiceDesign) |\n| qwen-tts/Qwen3-TTS-Tokenizer-12Hz | whole HF repo (folder) | `hf download Qwen/Qwen3-TTS-Tokenizer-12Hz --local-dir …` | [Qwen3-TTS tokenizer](https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3-TTS-Tokenizer-12Hz) |\n\nTTS node pack: [flybirdxx/ComfyUI-Qwen-TTS](https://github.com/flybirdxx/ComfyUI-Qwen-TTS). Official guide: [docs.comfy.org — Wan 2.2 S2V](https://docs.comfy.org/tutorials/video/wan/wan2-2-s2v).\n\nOptional: `wan2.2_s2v_14B_bf16.safetensors` (same repo) — less fp8 degradation, ~2× the VRAM.\n\n**Speed LoRA on (shipped):** STEPS 4, CFG 1.0.\n**Group 01 bypassed:** STEPS 20, CFG 6.0 (both are the two primitives in group 04; they feed all three samplers)."
   ],
