   "title": "EXAMPLE CARD — Kailani, original anime (copy into the card to use)",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "# EXAMPLE CARD — Kailani, original anime version\n\nThe live card above is the **photorealistic** Kailani. This is the original drawn version, kept as an example of a non-photographic card. To use it, copy the block into the CHARACTER CARD node.\n\nStyle lives **only** in the card's `Art style:` line; the templates never name a medium. For a drawn card, also switch the upscaler back to `RealESRGAN_x4plus_anime_6B.pth`.\n\n```\nCharacter name: KAILANI\nScope: Animation\nArt style: anime style, clean line art, cel shading\nCharacter: a lean athletic teenage surfer girl with sun-kissed tan skin, wavy sun-bleached hair streaked with ocean-blue tips tied in a loose messy braid, bright turquoise eyes.\nDefault outfit: a coral-orange rash guard top and white boardshorts, barefoot, a silver ankle bracelet.\nSignature prop: a yellow surfboard with a hibiscus flower decal.\nSetting: a sunny beach surf town.\nColor palette: turquoise, coral-orange, sand-tan and white.\nVoice: a young woman in her late teens with a bright, warm, slightly husky mid-high voice; relaxed and upbeat, laid-back surfer energy, a smile in her voice, natural conversational pace, clear articulation.\n```\n"
   ],
